  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Automatic game discovery is repaired. Every managed plugin now scans on startup, even with no saved Lexeditor path. Discovery checks Steam manifests first, validates only the plugin's declared required files, persists valid roots, and does not probe guessed folders across every drive. Expensive archive extraction is no longer part of startup discovery; it runs when that plugin opens. An empty-config test found a new install, left a missing game Absent, proved startup did not prepare data, and passed the rendered Home and full-host regressions.",
